[I] High performance, multi-platform VNC client and server

[T] TigerVNC is a high-speed version of VNC based on the RealVNC 4 and X.org
[T] code bases, providing a VNC viewer and servers including Xvnc and a
[T] module for existing X sessions. VNC is a remote display system to view
[T] and interact with a desktop running on another computer over the
[T] network.

[U] https://github.com/tigervnc/tigervnc

[A] TigerVNC
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.16.2

